  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - Due to the loss of landscaping associated with the proposed on-site parking layout the proposed on-site parking spaces are considered unacceptable and harmful to the appearance of the area and contrary to Policies T.1.4 (Car and Cycle Parking and Servicing Facilities), T.5.3 (Vehicle Crossovers and Hardstandings) and ENV - B.1.1 (New Development) of the Unitary Development Plan and Section 4.0 of the Residential Extension Guidelines (Two Storey Side and First Floor Rear Extensions). Consequently the proposal will not have suitable on-site parking provision and will have an adverse impact on the availability of on-street parking, the flow of traffic and the safety of pedestrians in the nearby area."
